{"step_index":40,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T20:52:06Z","input_tokens":4558,"cache_read_tokens":49401,"output_tokens":5759,"thinking":"Initial focus is on replicating the styling from the provided HTML file to maintain visual consistency. Observed CSS tokens and classes that need to be implemented within `index.html`, specifically `:root`, `@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark)`, and a range of classes. The plan is to ensure identical styling for elements like `.wrap`, `.card`, and other components of the student quiz site.\n\n\nObserved a comprehensive structure including a wrapper, start card, lock, exam display, results, and a warning modal for tab switching violations. Identified specific HTML elements within each section, such as the start card with input fields for name and section, and the exam card containing progress indicators, questions, and options. Determined that the quiz data will be loaded dynamically from Firebase Firestore.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Quiz</title>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f4f6fb;--card:#fff;--tx:#1b2333;--mu:#5d6779;--pr:#2f5bea;--ok:#12a150;--bad:#d93036;--bd:#dde2ee}\n@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#10141f;--card:#1a2030;--tx:#e8ecf6;--mu:#9aa5bb;--pr:#6f93ff;--ok:#39c47a;--bad:#ff6b70;--bd:#2c354b}}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);padding:16px}\n.wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:14px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:14px}\nh1{font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 0 6px}h2{font-size:1.1rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np,li{color:var(--mu);line-height:1.5}\ninput{width:100%;padding:12px;margin:6px 0 14px;border:1px solid var(--bd);border-radius:10px;font-size:1rem;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx)}\nbutton{font-size:1rem;padding:12px 20px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--pr);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\nbutton.sec{background:transparent;color:var(--pr);border:1px solid var(--pr)}\n.hide{display:none!important}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n.bar{height:8px;background:var(--bd);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:16px}\n#tb{height:100%;width:100%;background:var(--pr);transition:width .1s linear}\n#tb.low{background:var(--bad)}\n#q{white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.5}\n.opt{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;background:var(--bg);color:var(--tx);border:2px solid var(--bd);margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:500;font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.95rem;white-space:pre-wrap}\n.opt.sel{border-color:var(--pr);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--pr) 14%,var(--bg))}\n.warn{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:9;padding:20px}\n.warn .card{max-width:420px;text-align:center;border:2px solid var(--bad)}\n.big{font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--pr)}\n.fb{border-left:5px solid var(--bd)}\n.fb.ok{border-left-color:var(--ok)}.fb.no{border-left-color:var(--bad)}\n.tag{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;color:#fff}\n.tag.ok{background:var(--ok)}.tag.no{background:var(--bad)}\n.fb pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:inherit;margin:8px 0;font-weight:600}\n.fb div{margin:4px 0;font-size:.95rem}\n.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n\n<div id=\"start\" class=\"card\">\n  <h1 id=\"title\">Loading Quiz...</h1>\n  <p id=\"desc\">Connecting to Firebase...</p>\n  <label>Full Name<input id=\"nm\" placeholder=\"Juan Dela Cruz\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n  <label>Section<input id=\"sc\" placeholder=\"e.g. BSIT 2-A\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label>\n  <ul id=\"rules\">\n    <li id=\"r-timer\">Each question has a timer. When time runs out, it moves on automatically.</li>\n    <li id=\"r-tab\">Switching tabs or minimizing windows will result in point deductions.</li>\n    <li>You cannot go back to previous questions.</li>\n    <li>Your score and per-question feedback appear right after the quiz.</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p id=\"err\" style=\"color:var(--bad);margin:0 0 10px\"></p>\n  <button id=\"go\" disabled>Start Quiz</button>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"lock\" class=\"card hide\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <h1>You have already responded</h1>\n  <p id=\"lk1\">You can no longer open or retake this quiz.</p>\n  <p id=\"lk2\"></p>\n  <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\"><button id=\"lkdl\" class=\"hide\">Download Result File</button></div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"exam\" class=\"hide\">\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"top\"><span id=\"prog\"></span><span id=\"sw\"></span><span id=\"tm\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"bar\" id=\"pbar\"><div id=\"tb\"></div></div>\n    <div id=\"q\"></div>\n    <div id=\"opts\"></div>\n    <button id=\"nx\">Next</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"res\" class=\"hide\">\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <h1 id=\"rn\"></h1>\n    <div class=\"big\" id=\"rs\"></div>\n    <p id=\"rd\"></p>\n    <div class=\"row\" style=\"justify-content:center\">\n      <button id=\"dl\">Download Result File</button>\n      <button class=\"sec\" id=\"cp\">Copy Result Code</button>\n    </div>\n    <p style=\"font-size:.85rem\">Give the downloaded file or the result code to your instructor. Your result is also saved on this device.</p>\n  </div>\n  <h2>Feedback per Question</h2>\n  <div id=\"fbs\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"warn\" class=\"warn hide\"><div class=\"card\">\n  <h2 style=\"color:var(--bad)\">You left the quiz tab/window!</h2>\n  <p><b id=\"wp\">-1 point</b> will be deducted from your score.<br>Total violations: <b id=\"wc\">0</b></p>\n  <button id=\"wbtn\">Continue</button>\n</div></div>\n\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport { getActiveQuiz, saveSubmission } from \"./firebase-config.js\";\n\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nconst quizId=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get(\"quiz\")||\"active\";\nconst LOCK='ds_quiz_lock_'+quizId;\n\nlet quizData=null;\nlet items=[];\nlet idx=0;\nlet sel=null;\nlet answers=[];\nlet switches=0;\nlet running=false;\nlet away=false;\nlet deadline=0;\nlet iv=null;\nlet startedAt=0;\nlet person={};\n\nfunction shuffle(arr){\n  const a=[...arr];\n  for(let i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){\n    const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));\n    [a[i],a[j]]=[a[j],a[i]];\n  }\n  return a;\n}\n\nfunction initDisplay(data){\n  quizData=data;\n  $('title').textContent=data.title||\"Quiz\";\n  $('desc').textContent=data.description||\"\";\n  const st=data.settings||{};\n  if(st.enableTimer===false){\n    $('r-timer').textContent=\"There is no time limit for questions.\";\n  }else{\n    $('r-timer').textContent=\"Each question has \"+(st.timePerQuestion||20)+\" seconds. When time runs out, it moves on automatically.\";\n  }\n  if(st.enableTabViolation===false){\n    $('r-tab').style.display='none';\n  }else{\n    $('r-tab').textContent=\"Every tab switch or minimizing costs -\"+(st.tabViolationPenalty!=null?st.tabViolationPenalty:1)+\" point(s).\";\n    $('wp').textContent=\"-\"+(st.tabViolationPenalty!=null?st.tabViolationPenalty:1)+\" point(s)\";\n  }\n  $('go').disabled=false;\n}\n\ngetActiveQuiz(quizId).then(data=>{\n  initDisplay(data);\n}).catch(()=>{\n  import(\"./firebase-config.js\").then(m=>{\n    initDisplay(m.defaultQuiz);\n  });\n});\n\n$('go').onclick=()=>{\n  const n=$('nm').value.trim(),s=$('sc').value.trim();\n  if(!n||!s){\n    $('err').textContent='Please enter your name and section first.';\n    return;\n  }\n  try{\n    if(localStorage.getItem(LOCK)){\n      showLock();\n      return;\n    }\n    localStorage.setItem(LOCK,JSON.stringify({state:'started',n,s,ts:Date.now()}));\n  }catch(e){}\n  person={n,s};\n  const st=quizData.settings||{};\n  let qSource=quizData.questions||[];\n  if(st.randomizeQuestions){\n    qSource=shuffle(qSource);\n  }\n  items=qSource.map(item=>{\n    const choices=[\n      {t:item.correct,c:true},\n      ...(item.wrongs||[]).map(w=>({t:w,c:false}))\n    ];\n    return {\n      q:item.q,\n      e:item.explanation||\"\",\n      opts:st.randomizeAnswers?shuffle(choices):choices\n    };\n  });\n  idx=0;\n  answers=[];\n  switches=0;\n  running=true;\n  startedAt=Date.now();\n  $('start').classList.add('hide');\n  $('exam').classList.remove('hide');\n  show();\n};\n\nfunction show(){\n  const it=items[idx];\n  sel=null;\n  const st=quizData.settings||{};\n  $('prog').textContent='Question '+(idx+1)+' / '+items.length;\n  if(st.enableTabViolation!==false){\n    $('sw').textContent='Violations: '+switches;\n  }else{\n    $('sw').textContent='';\n  }\n  $('q').textContent=(idx+1)+'. '+it.q;\n  const box=$('opts');\n  box.innerHTML='';\n  it.opts.forEach((o,k)=>{\n    const b=document.createElement('button');\n    b.className='opt';\n    b.textContent=String.fromCharCode(65+k)+'. '+o.t;\n    b.onclick=()=>{\n      sel=k;\n      [...box.children].forEach((c,j)=>c.classList.toggle('sel',j===k));\n    };\n    box.appendChild(b);\n  });\n  $('nx').textContent=idx===items.length-1?'Finish':'Next';\n  if(st.enableTimer!==false){\n    $('pbar').classList.remove('hide');\n    $('tm').classList.remove('hide');\n    const secs=st.timePerQuestion||20;\n    deadline=Date.now()+secs*1000;\n    clearInterval(iv);\n    iv=setInterval(()=>tick(secs),100);\n    tick(secs);\n  }else{\n    $('pbar').classList.add('hide');\n    $('tm').classList.add('hide');\n    clearInterval(iv);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction tick(secs){\n  const left=Math.max(0,deadline-Date.now());\n  $('tm').textContent=Math.ceil(left/1000)+'s';\n  $('tb').style.width=(left/(secs*1000)*100)+'%';\n  $('tb').classList.toggle('low',left<6000);\n  if(left<=0)next();\n}\n\nfunction next(){\n  clearInterval(iv);\n  answers[idx]=sel;\n  if(idx<items.length-1){\n    idx++;\n    show();\n  }else{\n    finish(